msgid "Semver"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/babylon_README.md:101
msgid ""
"Babylon follows semver in most situations. The only thing to note is that"
" some spec-compliancy bug fixes may be released under patch versions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/babylon_README.md:103
msgid ""
"For example: We push a fix to early error on something like "
"[#107](https://github.com/babel/babylon/pull/107) - multiple default "
"exports per file. That would be considered a bug fix even though it would"
" cause a build to fail."
msgstr ""

